contentText:
Hailee Steinfeld is bringing a little extra magic to her role in Disney&#8217;s new animated feature Hexed , contributing an enchanting cover of a hit by The Cars in addition to leading the voice cast.

Released Friday (Oct. 23) ahead of the movie&#8217;s theatrical premiere Nov. 25, the singer/actress&#8217; version of &#8220;Magic&#8221; keeps all of the 1980s flair of The Cars&#8217; original recording, while Steinfeld&#8217;s bright vocals give it a new pop sheen. &#8220;Just a little bit of magic pulls me through,&#8221; she sings. &#8220;I&#8217;ve got a hold on you.&#8221;

